@startuml inter_process_communication

left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho

class "Logging Client" as LoggingClient <<Process>>
class "mw::log::detail::DataRouterBackend" as Backend
class "score::message_passing::IClientConnection" as ClientConnection
class "Datarouter" as Datarouter <<Process>>
class "score::message_passing::IServer" as DrServer
class "Shared Memory" as SharedMemory <<Shared Memory>>

LoggingClient --> Backend
Backend --> ClientConnection
Datarouter --> DrServer

LoggingClient --> SharedMemory : Creates and writes to\n/tmp/logging.<appid>.<uid>.shmem\n(read-only for group and others)
Datarouter --> SharedMemory : Read-only access

ClientConnection --> DrServer : Messages from the client\n(kConnect, kAcquireResponse)
DrServer --> ClientConnection : Notifications to the client\n(kAcquireRequest)

note top of ClientConnection : One connection per client. Sends messages and receives notifications through a notify callback.

note bottom of DrServer : Shared server for all clients at /logging.datarouter_recv (QNX: /mw_com/message_passing/logging.datarouter_recv).

@enduml
